Hey, look at this.

4
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:06,440
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

5
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:06,440
DRIVE SHOT COMPLETED!

6
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:06,440
There's an article about Tsubasa.

7
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:09,960
"Tsubasa Ozora has perfected his miraculous Drive Shot.

8
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:12,720
Only 2 matches remain for Nankatsu's 3rd victory."

9
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:16,670
The semi-finals will be between Nankatsu-Furano and Toho-Meiwa Higashi.

10
00:00:16,670 --> 00:00:19,470
Isn't it obvious that the final will be between Nankatsu and Toho?

11
00:00:19,470 --> 00:00:21,500
We still don't know that.

12
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,670
Urabe!

13
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:26,280
Tsubasa's Drive Shot may be persistent, but

14
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:29,880
Drive Shot: Diving Shot, Eagle Shot

15
00:00:26,280 --> 00:00:29,880
it will be difficult for him to win alone against Furano's team play.

16
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:36,660
Moreover, Toho's opponents, the regular 8 of Meiwa Higashi, are former Meiwa FC members,

17
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:35,380
MEIWA HIGASHI MIDDLE SCHOOL

18
00:00:36,660 --> 00:00:39,390
the friends who fought alongside Hyuga back then.

19
00:00:36,890 --> 00:00:39,390
MEIWA FC

20
00:00:39,390 --> 00:00:42,260
So there will be a showdown between Coach Kira's students?

21
00:00:42,260 --> 00:00:46,770
Meiwa Higashi also knows Hyuga and his friends' personalities and habits.

22
00:00:46,770 --> 00:00:48,420
That's not all.

23
00:00:48,420 --> 00:00:51,940
We're sure they'll put everything they have into today's match.

24
00:00:51,940 --> 00:00:55,200
Just like we did against Nankatsu...

25
00:00:55,960 --> 00:01:00,700
If Toho doesn't use Hyuga in this semi-final match,

26
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:05,330
it's impossible to know who will win between Toho and Meiwa Higashi.

