66
00:02:40,340 --> 00:02:45,350
EPISODE 43:
THE FIERCE TIGER IGNITES

67
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:45,500
In the National Middle School Football Tournament, 47 teams

68
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:48,130
representing each region of Japan competed,

69
00:02:48,130 --> 00:02:49,600
and all but four lost!

70
00:02:49,600 --> 00:02:52,310
The first semi-final match is about to begin!

71
00:02:52,310 --> 00:02:55,150
The hosts, representatives of Saitama prefecture, Meiwa Higashi,

72
00:02:55,150 --> 00:02:58,690
and the Tokyo representatives, Toho Academy, will clash.

73
00:02:58,690 --> 00:03:02,150
Players from both teams have taken the field.

74
00:03:04,990 --> 00:03:07,330
Toho is considered a championship contender,

75
00:03:07,330 --> 00:03:12,040
and while resting their ace Hyuga, they've been winning their matches easily.

76
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:17,710
On the other hand, Meiwa Higashi won by playing characteristically aggressive football.

77
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,150
Just watch, Toho.

78
00:03:19,150 --> 00:03:21,260
We're the ones who will beat you.

79
00:03:21,940 --> 00:03:24,140
Senpai, we won't lose!

80
00:03:24,140 --> 00:03:27,560
It seems Hyuga is on the bench again today.

81
00:03:27,560 --> 00:03:28,310
Hyuga!

82
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:30,060
So you're on the bench again.

83
00:03:30,060 --> 00:03:31,270
Hyuga-kun...

84
00:03:35,020 --> 00:03:37,320
This match is ours.

85
00:03:38,860 --> 00:03:40,480
Go Meiwa Higashi!

86
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:43,870
Because they're playing at home, the stands are filled with Meiwa Higashi supporters.

87
00:03:43,870 --> 00:03:47,120
They'll be reliable allies in this important match.

88
00:03:47,120 --> 00:03:49,410
As expected, Hyuga is on the bench.

89
00:03:49,410 --> 00:03:52,870
We'll only have to watch out for Takeshi and Wakashimazu.

90
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:55,680
We know everything about them:

91
00:03:55,680 --> 00:03:58,550
Their personalities, their game, their moves, and their weak points.

92
00:03:58,550 --> 00:04:00,880
Because we used to be teammates.

93
00:04:00,880 --> 00:04:04,620
We can keep Takeshi in check and steal a goal from Wakashimazu.

94
00:04:04,620 --> 00:04:08,760
If Kojiro Hyuga isn't in Toho, we can definitely win!

95
00:04:08,760 --> 00:04:11,850
We'll absolutely beat Toho!

96
00:04:11,850 --> 00:04:13,350
Yes!

97
00:04:14,240 --> 00:04:19,690
The first semi-final match started with Meiwa Higashi's kick-off.

98
00:04:21,490 --> 00:04:23,490
Alright, here we go!

99
00:04:23,490 --> 00:04:24,740
Captain!

100
00:04:31,290 --> 00:04:35,580
At kick-off, Meiwa Higashi strings a series of passes and attacks continuously!

101
00:04:35,580 --> 00:04:37,410
Go go Meiwa Higashi!

102
00:04:37,410 --> 00:04:39,210
Go go Meiwa Higashi!

103
00:04:39,210 --> 00:04:41,170
As if we'd lose to the likes of you!

104
00:04:41,170 --> 00:04:41,840
Sawaki!

105
00:04:43,850 --> 00:04:46,720
Meiwa Higashi's attack is going well!

106
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,550
The first goal will be ours!

107
00:04:50,290 --> 00:04:54,640
Suddenly, Toho's Takeshi Sawada-kun stops Meiwa Higashi's fierce attack!

108
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:56,940
Well played.

109
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:57,930
We will win!

110
00:04:57,930 --> 00:05:01,190
This is the last match we have to play without Hyuga.

111
00:05:01,710 --> 00:05:03,030
Takeshi...

112
00:05:03,030 --> 00:05:07,660
Meiwa Higashi sends two players to stop Toho's playmaker Sawada.

113
00:05:07,660 --> 00:05:09,490
Come on, Takeshi!

114
00:05:09,490 --> 00:05:13,160
You're younger than us; there's no way we can lose to you!

115
00:05:13,830 --> 00:05:14,540
Here!

116
00:05:14,540 --> 00:05:17,040
Sawada completes his job with a pass.

117
00:05:18,280 --> 00:05:20,290
However, his pass was read!

118
00:05:20,790 --> 00:05:22,590
It can't reach Sorimachi-kun!

119
00:05:22,590 --> 00:05:25,170
We can completely read your moves.

120
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:26,800
Take this!

121
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:29,300
Meiwa Higashi attacks again!

122
00:05:30,180 --> 00:05:32,810
Meiwa Higashi is doing very well today.

123
00:05:32,810 --> 00:05:36,190
Especially because Toho is a special opponent for Meiwa Higashi.

124
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:40,190
They must have focused solely on this match and prepared thoroughly.

125
00:05:40,190 --> 00:05:41,360
Sawaki!

126
00:05:42,530 --> 00:05:45,900
Meiwa Higashi quickly enters shooting range.

127
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:47,990
Eat this!

128
00:05:47,990 --> 00:05:51,370
Sawaki from Meiwa Higashi takes the first shot of the match!

129
00:05:51,370 --> 00:05:52,240
In the goal!

130
00:05:53,270 --> 00:05:54,340
He did it!

131
00:05:54,340 --> 00:05:56,540
A good save by goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun!

132
00:05:56,540 --> 00:05:58,040
Nice, Wakashimazu-san!

133
00:05:58,040 --> 00:06:00,920
As expected from the number 1 goalkeeper of the tournament.

134
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:03,630
Wakashimazu still maintains his record!

135
00:06:05,750 --> 00:06:07,430
Just as expected from you, Wakashimazu.

136
00:06:07,430 --> 00:06:09,350
But we're just getting started...

137
00:06:09,350 --> 00:06:11,550
I'll definitely score a goal on you!

138
00:06:13,310 --> 00:06:14,430
Run!

139
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:17,890
The ball reaches forward Sorimachi-kun.

140
00:06:17,890 --> 00:06:19,060
Sorimachi-san!

141
00:06:19,730 --> 00:06:22,190
This is another favorite tactic of Toho!

142
00:06:23,390 --> 00:06:25,310
Ahh, this pass was also intercepted!

143
00:06:25,310 --> 00:06:27,530
Meiwa Higashi read this play too!

144
00:06:27,530 --> 00:06:28,610
Here!

145
00:06:30,430 --> 00:06:33,410
We have 20 minutes left in the first half,

146
00:06:33,410 --> 00:06:35,470
and neither team has scored yet.

147
00:06:35,470 --> 00:06:38,080
This 0-0 tension balance remained unbroken.

148
00:06:38,640 --> 00:06:43,590
The combination play between forward Sorimachi, filling in for Toho's ace Hyuga, and Toho's young

149
00:06:43,590 --> 00:06:47,090
playmaker Sawada is completely stalled!

150
00:06:47,090 --> 00:06:49,150
They can't find a chance to score.

151
00:06:49,150 --> 00:06:50,010
Alright!

152
00:06:50,010 --> 00:06:52,410
This isn't good. My passes aren't working.

153
00:06:52,970 --> 00:06:56,000
Even though it feels like Meiwa Higashi is in control of the game,

154
00:06:57,420 --> 00:06:59,420
Wakashimazu stopping them

155
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:02,900
prevents them from scoring and they can't get on the board.

156
00:07:02,210 --> 00:07:02,900
Damn it!

157
00:07:03,410 --> 00:07:05,190
For you, Takeshi!

158
00:07:07,410 --> 00:07:09,090
Sawada brings the ball to the opposite half!

159
00:07:09,090 --> 00:07:11,450
Who will he pass to next?

160
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:14,580
Sorimachi-san is being marked.

161
00:07:14,580 --> 00:07:15,280
Here!

162
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:16,350
He sends it to the side.

163
00:07:16,350 --> 00:07:16,830
Alright!

164
00:07:17,330 --> 00:07:17,650
Ah!

165
00:07:17,650 --> 00:07:20,160
Meiwa Higashi intercepted again!

166
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:21,250
Useless.

167
00:07:21,250 --> 00:07:23,630
Every move I make is being read.

168
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:26,250
I wish Hyuga-san were here right now...

169
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:37,050
Unfortunately, just as Meiwa Higashi was about to make a final attack,

170
00:07:37,050 --> 00:07:39,600
the whistle blew!

171
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:42,100
Neither side scored in the first half.

172
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:44,540
The championship contender Toho

173
00:07:44,540 --> 00:07:49,070
enters halftime without scoring for the first time.

174
00:07:51,690 --> 00:07:54,280
Toho is being suppressed.

175
00:07:54,280 --> 00:07:54,910
Yes.

176
00:07:54,910 --> 00:07:57,540
This match will be tough for them without Hyuga.

177
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:06,670
MEIWA HIGASHI MIDDLE SCHOOL
SAITAMA PREFECTURE

178
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:06,670
Alright! Our defense was perfect in the first half.

179
00:08:06,670 --> 00:08:08,400
All we have to do is score.

180
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:10,170
We must score 1 point at all costs!

181
00:08:10,170 --> 00:08:14,300
If we keep attacking like this, a definite chance will come!

182
00:08:14,870 --> 00:08:16,360
Don't let that chance slip away!

183
00:08:16,360 --> 00:08:17,300
Okay!

184
00:08:17,300 --> 00:08:18,890
TOHO ACADEMY
TOKYO

185
00:08:18,890 --> 00:08:19,970
Damn it!

186
00:08:19,970 --> 00:08:22,060
We're being swept off our feet by their speed.

187
00:08:22,060 --> 00:08:24,190
How can they steal the ball from us so easily?

188
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:26,450
If this continues, things won't end well.

189
00:08:29,390 --> 00:08:31,170
Alright everyone, gather up.

190
00:08:35,070 --> 00:08:38,930
Sawada. You're being completely read.

191
00:08:38,930 --> 00:08:40,330
It's okay to take risks.

192
00:08:40,330 --> 00:08:44,050
Change your tactics a bit in the second half; try shifting your position.

193
00:08:44,050 --> 00:08:45,560
O-Okay.

194
00:08:45,560 --> 00:08:47,710
Sorimachi, keep actively aiming to score.

195
00:08:47,710 --> 00:08:49,340
Take long shots if necessary.

196
00:08:49,340 --> 00:08:52,420
Their goalkeeper isn't as good as Wakashimazu.

197
00:08:52,420 --> 00:08:54,180
Shoot if you get the chance.

198
00:08:54,180 --> 00:08:54,970
Okay!

199
00:08:54,970 --> 00:08:56,100
Understood?

200
00:08:56,100 --> 00:08:57,970
We will definitely win this match!

201
00:08:57,970 --> 00:08:59,910
No substitutions will be made.

202
00:08:59,910 --> 00:09:02,180
We'll play with the same players from the first half.

203
00:09:02,180 --> 00:09:03,850
Okay...

204
00:09:04,470 --> 00:09:08,910
If only the Captain were playing, this game would be much easier...

205
00:09:11,110 --> 00:09:13,040
What will you do, Mikami-san?

206
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:18,030
He definitely has talent, but Kojiro Hyuga hasn't played in this entire tournament.

207
00:09:18,030 --> 00:09:19,120
Really.

208
00:09:19,120 --> 00:09:21,350
3-0...

209
00:09:21,350 --> 00:09:24,620
If I were playing, the score in this match would be 3-0.

210
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:26,070
Damn it.

211
00:09:26,070 --> 00:09:30,170
If they get ahead of us in the second half, I'll go out...

212
00:09:30,170 --> 00:09:32,550
I'll run onto the field and play!

213
00:09:34,920 --> 00:09:38,760
The second half will start with Toho Academy's kick-off.

214
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:39,470
Good luck Toho!

215
00:09:40,510 --> 00:09:43,110
No matter what, only 30 minutes remain.

216
00:09:43,110 --> 00:09:45,270
Which team will advance to the grand finals?

217
00:09:45,270 --> 00:09:47,250
Go go, Meiwa Higashi!

218
00:09:47,250 --> 00:09:49,020
Go go, Meiwa Higashi!

219
00:09:49,790 --> 00:09:53,150
Perhaps it's only natural that they can read my moves...

220
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:56,780
Most of Meiwa Higashi's players are my friends from the Meiwa FC team.

221
00:09:56,780 --> 00:09:59,740
I played with them in elementary school.

222
00:09:59,740 --> 00:10:03,560
Moreover, they were all trained by Coach Kira.

223
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:05,410
They're not average players.

224
00:10:05,410 --> 00:10:08,460
If there were another midfielder like me, like Tsubasa

225
00:10:08,460 --> 00:10:11,500
... I wonder, how would he get through?

226
00:10:11,500 --> 00:10:13,500
I wish Hyuga-san were here...

227
00:10:14,490 --> 00:10:15,460
Got it!

228
00:10:15,460 --> 00:10:17,720
Sawada-kun easily loses the ball!

229
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,800
No way!

230
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:20,300
Nice steal!

231
00:10:20,300 --> 00:10:22,670
Meiwa Higashi keeps attacking quickly!

232
00:10:22,670 --> 00:10:24,810
Will Meiwa Higashi gain momentum in this half as well?

233
00:10:24,810 --> 00:10:27,710
Being so easily read caused him to lose his composure.

234
00:10:27,710 --> 00:10:28,410
Eh?

235
00:10:28,410 --> 00:10:32,060
Perhaps being a playmaker is too heavy a burden for a first-year like Sawada.

236
00:10:32,060 --> 00:10:33,530
What am I doing?

237
00:10:33,530 --> 00:10:36,320
If I keep acting like this, we'll be swept away by their pace again.

238
00:10:36,320 --> 00:10:37,570
Takeshi...

239
00:10:37,570 --> 00:10:38,320
I'll stop you!

240
00:10:38,690 --> 00:10:39,570
Ah!

241
00:10:39,990 --> 00:10:41,490
It's a corner kick.

242
00:10:41,490 --> 00:10:43,450
This is the first corner of the second half.

243
00:10:43,450 --> 00:10:45,120
Alright, now's our chance!

244
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,760
This is our fourth corner kick.

245
00:10:46,760 --> 00:10:48,960
It could be our opportunity.

246
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,960
Imai! Go further!

247
00:10:50,960 --> 00:10:53,330
Toho tightens their ranks in front of the goal.

248
00:10:53,330 --> 00:10:55,250
Wakashimazu-kun gives his orders.

249
00:10:55,250 --> 00:10:57,210
Kawagoe-kun will take the corner kick.

250
00:10:57,210 --> 00:11:00,780
If I mess up, Wakashimazu will catch it.

251
00:11:00,780 --> 00:11:04,220
First, I have to send the ball where he can't reach it...

252
00:11:05,270 --> 00:11:05,970
Here!

253
00:11:05,970 --> 00:11:07,970
Too far from the goal!

254
00:11:07,970 --> 00:11:09,970
Wakashimazu can't jump to get it!

255
00:11:10,540 --> 00:11:11,850
Got it!

256
00:11:11,850 --> 00:11:13,270
Let's do this, everyone!

257
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:15,710
Go!

258
00:11:15,710 --> 00:11:17,860
Meiwa Higashi attacks with all members!

259
00:11:17,860 --> 00:11:18,620
What?

260
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:19,820
Clear it!

261
00:11:19,820 --> 00:11:22,200
Toho goes to stop them with full force!

262
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:25,490
A huge chance for Hori-kun, who is right in front of the goal!

263
00:11:25,490 --> 00:11:27,240
Go!

264
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,170
What?!

265
00:11:28,170 --> 00:11:29,450
Stopped!

266
00:11:29,450 --> 00:11:32,750
He managed to react to this shot that seemed like a done deal!

267
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:35,250
But the ball is still in play!

268
00:11:35,900 --> 00:11:38,260
Please clear it! Just clear the ball!

269
00:11:38,260 --> 00:11:39,510
Let's go!

270
00:11:39,510 --> 00:11:41,260
We'll defend! Clear the ball!

271
00:11:41,260 --> 00:11:42,550
Who's faster?!

272
00:11:42,550 --> 00:11:43,760
Shot or clearance?!

273
00:11:44,090 --> 00:11:45,000
Eat this!

274
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:47,930
Aggressive Football Coach Kira trained us!

275
00:11:47,930 --> 00:11:48,850
What?!

276
00:11:48,850 --> 00:11:52,060
Meiwa's Special Sliding Team has begun!

277
00:11:53,810 --> 00:11:55,860
We caught it!

278
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:57,520
There's no way I'll let you...!

279
00:12:04,660 --> 00:12:06,530
It's in!

280
00:12:06,530 --> 00:12:09,160
Meiwa Higashi's persistence bears fruit!

281
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:11,910
The first goal of the match is from Meiwa Higashi!

282
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:22,500
~Anime Lovers~
Instagram: AnimeSeverlerrr

283
00:12:22,470 --> 00:12:25,970
Finally, the tense 0-0 deadlock is broken!

284
00:12:27,020 --> 00:12:31,270
Meiwa Higashi deflected Wakashimazu-kun with a sliding shot on the loose ball.

285
00:12:31,270 --> 00:12:34,580
Toho's defense, their proud iron wall,

286
00:12:34,580 --> 00:12:37,060
has finally conceded their first goal in this tournament!

287
00:12:37,060 --> 00:12:39,360
Toho... allowed them to score.

288
00:12:41,860 --> 00:12:43,110
We did it!

289
00:12:43,110 --> 00:12:44,700
We scored a goal!

290
00:12:44,700 --> 00:12:47,700
They're celebrating because the score finally changed.

291
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:51,830
With this, Meiwa Higashi is one step closer to the grand final!

292
00:12:55,160 --> 00:12:56,210
Captain!

293
00:12:56,210 --> 00:12:57,540
Wait, Hyuga!

294
00:12:58,290 --> 00:12:59,710
That's Hyuga.

295
00:12:59,710 --> 00:13:00,340
Hyuga!

296
00:13:00,340 --> 00:13:01,510
Kojiro!

297
00:13:01,510 --> 00:13:03,050
Captain...

298
00:13:03,050 --> 00:13:04,380
Coach.

299
00:13:04,380 --> 00:13:06,470
What exactly are you doing?

300
00:13:06,470 --> 00:13:08,890
I don't intend to let you play in this match.

301
00:13:08,890 --> 00:13:10,600
Sit down, Hyuga.

302
00:13:10,600 --> 00:13:12,180
Those are my orders!

303
00:13:15,070 --> 00:13:18,560
Orders... Orders, orders...!

304
00:13:19,590 --> 00:13:22,110
Who died and made you king of the world?!

305
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:24,700
What makes you think you're always right?!

306
00:13:25,090 --> 00:13:25,860
What?

307
00:13:26,850 --> 00:13:32,290
Why? Why can't I play just one match?

308
00:13:32,680 --> 00:13:34,080
Captain...

309
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,380
Stop, Hyuga!

310
00:13:43,380 --> 00:13:45,000
Everyone, don't lose now!

311
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,300
They're only one point ahead.

312
00:13:46,300 --> 00:13:48,300
You have plenty of time!

313
00:13:48,300 --> 00:13:51,230
It's possible for you to turn this around!

314
00:13:51,230 --> 00:13:54,060
But, just this once, you have to do it without me!

315
00:13:54,060 --> 00:13:56,440
I'm begging you, everyone!

316
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,560
Hyuga.

317
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,720
Captain...

318
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:00,190
Hyuga-san.

319
00:14:00,710 --> 00:14:03,940
No matter what, I will play in the final!

320
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,500
Hyuga-kun.

321
00:14:10,240 --> 00:14:12,080
Alright. Let's do this, everyone!

322
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,490
Just as our captain said.

323
00:14:13,490 --> 00:14:14,710
They're only one point ahead.

324
00:14:14,710 --> 00:14:16,330
Let's get revenge immediately!

325
00:14:18,660 --> 00:14:19,460
Yes!

326
00:14:19,460 --> 00:14:21,540
We've won without our captain before.

327
00:14:21,540 --> 00:14:24,340
Let's show everything Toho can do!

328
00:14:24,340 --> 00:14:26,590
We will definitely win this match!

329
00:14:26,590 --> 00:14:27,830
Right!

330
00:14:27,830 --> 00:14:34,710
Before this match, we all swore we'd win without Hyuga-san.

331
00:14:34,710 --> 00:14:39,560
Also, if the coach doesn't let Hyuga play in tomorrow's final,

332
00:14:39,560 --> 00:14:42,520
we'll boycott the match entirely.

333
00:14:42,990 --> 00:14:45,030
Just watch, Captain!

334
00:14:45,470 --> 00:14:47,030
Everyone...

335
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:49,030
The match continues!

336
00:14:49,030 --> 00:14:52,980
After conceding a goal, what kind of attack will Toho mount?

337
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:53,800
Do you understand, everyone?

338
00:14:53,800 --> 00:14:55,040
We'll catch up no matter what!

339
00:14:55,040 --> 00:14:56,080
Yes!!

340
00:14:56,080 --> 00:15:00,170
Hah, we know every move that playmaker Takeshi might try.

341
00:15:00,170 --> 00:15:03,500
With this goal, we've practically secured our ticket to the finals.

342
00:15:05,340 --> 00:15:06,460
Let's go!

343
00:15:06,460 --> 00:15:10,840
Toho, desperate for the equalizer, fiercely advances into Meiwa's half.

344
00:15:10,840 --> 00:15:12,840
Don't let them move freely!

345
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:17,770
However, Meiwa Higashi's defense is spectacular today, earning full points!

346
00:15:17,770 --> 00:15:23,300
Will this defense be too tough to break without Toho's sidelined ace Hyuga?

347
00:15:23,300 --> 00:15:24,610
Everyone...

348
00:15:24,610 --> 00:15:28,440
If we can play Toho's standard in this game, we can definitely win.

349
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,530
Take this!

350
00:15:30,490 --> 00:15:32,130
Definitely being read!

351
00:15:32,130 --> 00:15:33,750
Sawada's pass won't reach!

352
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:34,490
Damn it!

353
00:15:34,490 --> 00:15:35,500
What?!

354
00:15:35,500 --> 00:15:37,500
He stole it in the blink of an eye!

355
00:15:37,500 --> 00:15:38,750
Nice, Takeshi!

356
00:15:38,750 --> 00:15:41,040
That's it! That's the spirit, Takeshi!

357
00:15:41,730 --> 00:15:43,400
If they steal from you, steal it back.

358
00:15:43,400 --> 00:15:45,290
That's all you have to do.

359
00:15:45,290 --> 00:15:47,050
Isn't that right, Tsubasa-san...?

360
00:15:47,050 --> 00:15:51,180
I'll become a goal-scoring midfielder just like you.

361
00:15:51,180 --> 00:15:52,380
Stop him!

362
00:15:52,380 --> 00:15:53,680
Damn it!

363
00:15:53,680 --> 00:15:56,220
Sawada masterfully advances toward the midfield.

364
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:57,770
He's going to shoot!

365
00:15:57,770 --> 00:15:59,220
Block him!

366
00:15:59,220 --> 00:16:01,950
My former upperclassmen... I've improved too!

367
00:16:01,950 --> 00:16:04,220
Sawada is ready to shoot!

368
00:16:04,220 --> 00:16:05,650
I won't let you score!

369
00:16:06,270 --> 00:16:07,770
Take!

370
00:16:07,770 --> 00:16:08,780
What?!

371
00:16:08,780 --> 00:16:09,440
Takeshi!

372
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:11,440
That's your move, Tsubasa.

373
00:16:12,910 --> 00:16:16,070
The pass reached Sorimachi for the first time!

374
00:16:16,070 --> 00:16:24,170
Until our captain returns, the center forward job is mine!

375
00:16:25,580 --> 00:16:27,380
It's in!

376
00:16:27,380 --> 00:16:29,000
Yes! Nice shot!

377
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:32,000
Toho, in the 15th minute of the second half,

378
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:35,680
tied the score with a perfect combination! It's now 1-1!

379
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:36,830
We did it!

380
00:16:36,830 --> 00:16:38,030
We did it, Captain!

381
00:16:38,030 --> 00:16:39,120
Hyuga-san!

382
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:40,020
Everyone!

383
00:16:40,700 --> 00:16:42,900
We finally tied the game!

384
00:16:42,900 --> 00:16:44,540
Nice shot, Sorimachi!

385
00:16:44,540 --> 00:16:48,020
And Takeshi, switching from a shot to a pass was a perfect decision!

386
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:50,470
Now we can't lose.

387
00:16:50,470 --> 00:16:56,280
Because no matter what, I won't let the opponent score again!

388
00:17:00,790 --> 00:17:03,460
Toho was panicking because they couldn't score in the first half,

389
00:17:03,460 --> 00:17:05,380
but now they've regained their confidence.

390
00:17:06,040 --> 00:17:09,290
This goal came thanks to Hyuga's encouragement.

391
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:10,700
Damn it.

392
00:17:10,700 --> 00:17:12,460
It's still a tie.

393
00:17:12,460 --> 00:17:16,340
After Toho equalized, they continued their attacks and gained momentum.

394
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:17,680
Go!

395
00:17:17,680 --> 00:17:19,100
Let's take the lead right away, guys!

396
00:17:19,650 --> 00:17:22,220
The game has now completely fallen to Toho's pace.

397
00:17:22,220 --> 00:17:27,480
To compensate for Hyuga not continuing in this tournament, Toho has often fought as a team.

398
00:17:27,480 --> 00:17:34,030
Therefore, their teamwork and the players' individual skills have greatly improved.

399
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:37,490
If you add Hyuga to this team now, they will be terrifying.

400
00:17:37,490 --> 00:17:41,050
Only a few minutes remain in this match!

401
00:17:41,050 --> 00:17:43,550
If it ends like this, considering Toho's Wakashimazu

402
00:17:43,550 --> 00:17:46,780
is the number 1 goalkeeper in the tournament,

403
00:17:46,780 --> 00:17:49,130
Meiwa Higashi will be at a huge disadvantage!

404
00:17:49,130 --> 00:17:52,630
A tie game is basically a loss for Meiwa Higashi.

405
00:17:52,630 --> 00:17:55,130
We can't lose after coming this far!

406
00:17:55,130 --> 00:17:58,050
Everyone! Don't settle for a tie game!

407
00:17:58,050 --> 00:18:01,510
Toho's football is to win at all costs!

408
00:18:01,510 --> 00:18:02,310
Yes!

409
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:05,430
After all, must I acknowledge that he's Toho's captain?

410
00:18:05,430 --> 00:18:10,250
The kid who abandoned his friends and disappeared at such a critical time,

411
00:18:10,250 --> 00:18:13,610
right after our victory in the preliminaries, entered the National competition.

412
00:18:13,610 --> 00:18:16,530
Yes! Don't be afraid, Sorimachi!

413
00:18:13,610 --> 00:18:18,320
Despite everything, our players still trust this kid, Kojiro Hyuga.

414
00:18:16,530 --> 00:18:18,320
You can do it yourself!

415
00:18:20,610 --> 00:18:22,790
All we're doing is defending.

416
00:18:22,790 --> 00:18:24,370
We have to attack somehow...

417
00:18:24,370 --> 00:18:25,370
No.

418
00:18:25,370 --> 00:18:26,870
Let them continue.

419
00:18:27,930 --> 00:18:30,880
We'll wait for the counter-attack and seize our chance!

420
00:18:30,880 --> 00:18:33,500
If we want to score against Wakashimazu, this is all we have.

421
00:18:34,030 --> 00:18:35,960
Okay, got it.

422
00:18:39,510 --> 00:18:40,180
Sorimachi-san!

423
00:18:40,910 --> 00:18:42,800
Toho's Sorimachi sends—

424
00:18:43,270 --> 00:18:44,250
They couldn't!

425
00:18:44,250 --> 00:18:46,310
Meiwa Higashi stopped the pass!

426
00:18:46,310 --> 00:18:47,600
Alright, now!

427
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:50,060
It was a quick long pass!

428
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:52,810
An instant counter-attack!

429
00:18:53,270 --> 00:18:54,320
They passed it!

430
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:58,320
Toho was so busy attacking that their defense is full of holes!

431
00:18:58,320 --> 00:18:59,570
No way!

432
00:18:59,570 --> 00:19:02,030
No one is chasing Sawaki!

433
00:19:03,240 --> 00:19:04,370
This is bad, Toho!

434
00:19:05,340 --> 00:19:07,040
Did you think I'd let you?!

435
00:19:07,040 --> 00:19:09,290
Whoa, as expected from you, Wakashimazu.

436
00:19:09,290 --> 00:19:13,290
Outside the penalty area, even as a goalkeeper, you're another field player!

437
00:19:13,290 --> 00:19:15,670
Instead of a tie, we'll aim for victory!

438
00:19:15,670 --> 00:19:16,880
Wakashimazu.

439
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:18,630
Damn it, he's underestimating us!

440
00:19:18,630 --> 00:19:19,670
Crush him!

441
00:19:19,670 --> 00:19:23,230
If we steal the ball from Wakashimazu, it'll be a free goal!

442
00:19:23,230 --> 00:19:25,180
This is the chance we've been waiting for!

443
00:19:25,180 --> 00:19:31,440
However, the more of you I get past, the less protected your front is!

444
00:19:31,440 --> 00:19:32,400
What?!

445
00:19:32,400 --> 00:19:33,520
Takeshi!

446
00:19:34,910 --> 00:19:35,520
Take this!

447
00:19:35,520 --> 00:19:37,240
The ball reached Sorimachi!

448
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:38,280
Will he shoot?

449
00:19:38,280 --> 00:19:39,610
Don't let him shoot!

450
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:42,490
Ah, he sent a back pass!

451
00:19:42,490 --> 00:19:43,280
What?!

452
00:19:43,280 --> 00:19:47,240
There! Wakashimazu-kun rushes toward the ball!

453
00:19:47,240 --> 00:19:48,370
Wakashimazu-san!

454
00:19:48,370 --> 00:19:49,370
Wakashimazu!

455
00:19:49,370 --> 00:19:50,620
That's enough, Wakashimazu!

456
00:19:52,060 --> 00:19:54,290
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu strikes the ball!

457
00:19:56,630 --> 00:19:57,990
It's in!

458
00:19:57,990 --> 00:20:00,800
A frighteningly powerful shot from Wakashimazu-kun!

459
00:20:00,800 --> 00:20:04,540
They made a comeback just before the match ended, 2-1!

460
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:06,300
You did it, Wakashimazu!

461
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:08,380
What a great attack from Toho!

462
00:20:08,380 --> 00:20:09,060
Yes.

463
00:20:09,060 --> 00:20:10,060
Damn it!

464
00:20:10,060 --> 00:20:11,220
We forgot that.

465
00:20:11,220 --> 00:20:13,600
Wakashimazu was originally a forward!

466
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:16,630
But Meiwa FC got Hyuga, so at Coach Kira's request,

467
00:20:16,630 --> 00:20:18,820
so that we could win the championship,

468
00:20:18,820 --> 00:20:21,610
he switched to goalkeeper in his place.

469
00:20:22,130 --> 00:20:22,940
Tch.

470
00:20:22,940 --> 00:20:24,610
We knew that!

471
00:20:24,610 --> 00:20:30,620
With his defense and offense, Wakashimazu
is truly Japan's number 1 goalkeeper.

472
00:20:30,620 --> 00:20:34,500
You conceded 2 goals from Wakashimazu, Jun.

473
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:39,550
I really want to help you play football full-time like the others.

474
00:20:40,370 --> 00:20:43,460
The whistle marking the end of the match has blown!

475
00:20:43,460 --> 00:20:47,720
Toho becomes the first team to advance to the final!

476
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:49,880
We did it, Captain! We won!

477
00:20:49,880 --> 00:20:50,720
Hyuga-san!

478
00:20:50,720 --> 00:20:51,690
That's it!

479
00:20:51,690 --> 00:20:52,820
Good job!

480
00:20:52,820 --> 00:20:54,480
Great work, everyone!

481
00:20:56,230 --> 00:20:57,770
Wakashimazu, you were amazing!

482
00:20:57,770 --> 00:20:58,340
Yes!

483
00:20:58,340 --> 00:20:59,760
You too, Takeshi.

484
00:20:59,760 --> 00:21:00,730
Hyuga-san!

485
00:21:00,730 --> 00:21:03,030
And you, Sorimachi, that was a great shot!

486
00:21:03,030 --> 00:21:04,490
We lost.

487
00:21:04,490 --> 00:21:08,990
We were sure we could beat Toho without Hyuga on their team.

488
00:21:08,990 --> 00:21:11,980
No, actually, Hyuga's power was immense.

489
00:21:13,040 --> 00:21:18,420
Even on the bench, Hyuga was a huge blessing for Toho today.

490
00:21:18,420 --> 00:21:23,380
If he hadn't encouraged them, we might have pulled this off.

491
00:21:23,380 --> 00:21:26,380
All of Toho truly is Hyuga.

492
00:21:26,810 --> 00:21:28,650
Katagiri-kun, I've decided.

493
00:21:28,650 --> 00:21:31,970
Even though he hasn't played a single match in this tournament,

494
00:21:31,970 --> 00:21:37,920
I'm going to take Kojiro Hyuga to Europe as Japan's center forward.

495
00:21:39,320 --> 00:21:40,190
Takeshi!

496
00:21:40,190 --> 00:21:40,900
Huh?

497
00:21:40,900 --> 00:21:44,470
Win the final tomorrow and become champions!

498
00:21:44,470 --> 00:21:46,240
You beat us!

499
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:48,800
We trust you, our little junior from Meiwa FC!

500
00:21:48,800 --> 00:21:50,200
Okay!

501
00:21:50,200 --> 00:21:53,700
Wakashimazu! Do your best to keep a clean sheet tomorrow.

502
00:21:53,700 --> 00:21:57,960
If you do that, the only ones who'll have scored on you will be us!

503
00:21:58,470 --> 00:22:00,340
Yes, I'll do my best!

504
00:22:00,340 --> 00:22:02,170
You'd better win!

505
00:22:05,480 --> 00:22:08,050
Alright, now it's our turn!

506
00:22:09,550 --> 00:22:11,810
It has begun, Matsuyama-kun.

507
00:22:11,810 --> 00:22:14,560
Just as I hoped, Tsubasa!

508
00:22:19,500 --> 00:22:34,500
~Anime Lovers~
You can share your thoughts about this episode under our Instagram posts...

